{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "7ba85e222c86f3ea19cb70a04b5cea845b59ea6f12878214aa442a4e93d49986", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# MS-03 — Required Answer Elements"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "d68070abb64f36ee3bf1832e279db8f7291f6111bd6ae71f613bdb1f97cfc310", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact identifies what each 4CH1 mark scheme actually requires for credit, as\nparsed in the official exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): the accepted-answer\nelement at the core of each mark point, the conditions attached to names versus\nformulae, the named points that explanation items require, and the OWTTE latitude\nthat defines semantic equivalence. Reading these requirements off the parsed text is\nexactly what the mark-scheme text is for — no requirement here is invented. Every\nclaim is carried on a bounded, locator-addressed excerpt from the run's evidence\npack. Research artifact; canonical planes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "c0e61511a5f716f256425598424f57a46b7dba7395f386dd50038999565601c6", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** the accepted-answer core; name/formula conditions; the required points\nof linked explanations; OWTTE equivalence; alternative-element breadth; CSQ-linked\nrequirements.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 1C paper of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** the full alternatives catalogue (MS-04), mark-loss patterns\n(MS-05), partial-credit mechanics (MS-06)."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "6af04b1d6d896e0d0d78956d906ded463922fde6fede1839ab48d1d54edf4694", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nEvery mark point names its required element explicitly: a formula, a name, a value,\nor a named semantic point. Where a name and a formula can both be given, the scheme\nstates the rule — the name suffices and a wrong formula is ignored, or both must be\ncorrect. Explanation items decompose into named points (M1 the value, M2 the\nmechanism), each independently required. OWTTE (\"or words to that effect\") marks the\nschemes' semantic-equivalence latitude: the chemistry must be right, the wording is\nfree. And where multiple substances satisfy the chemistry, the requirement lists\nthem (Li+ ALLOW Sr2+). The required-element layer is therefore fully explicit in the\nparsed text — candidates can rehearse against exactly what is required, in the\nboard's own terms."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:sec:MAIN_ANALYSIS", "content_sha256": "7fb62975e791ae44ab0c85c87c0d040939264ba410482842e28232986fbe958b", "heading": "Main Analysis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Main Analysis"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "e38b53ad9340492304718d80ccef55818e5cfb6be314f29bdf83ce5e0bf540e0", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 1C official extraction (51 bounded\nline-window excerpts, locators preserved; mark-scheme text cited verbatim). No\nexaminer reports consumed; no specimen material cited; supplementary sources not\nconsumed for claims."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "ce782e073b91924eb643a114a8dada299aefb2b441302d0327f833894135e433", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nRequired-element readings are anchored on one paper file of the pack; the inventory\nis a demonstrated floor, not a claimed census of every required-element form across\nall sessions. Excerpt-window truncation is respected — where a guidance cell is cut\noff in the window, the unquoted remainder is not paraphrased. No canonical planes\nwere written."}
