{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:rec:MS-013", "content_sha256": "fd74ccfac62fdb64bb5fc561c799168b2df36a35b2bae919b7aa5c04bbcb7519", "heading": "MS-013", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-013", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-013", "text": "### MS-013 — The accepted-answer core of a mark point\n\n**Claim:** each mark point's required element is printed as the point's answer text.\n**Evidence:** the flame-test ion point requires the formula — \"> Li+ ALLOW Sr2+\"\nwith its point line \"- **(1)** Li+ ALLOW Sr2+\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 172-186); the precipitate point requires the name\nor formula (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 174-188).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:rec:MS-014", "content_sha256": "391d6696559cb620b9dc52a44a7d82d639fdf0c40437a5a211969e69d4e764d2", "heading": "MS-014", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-014", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-014", "text": "### MS-014 — Name/formula conditions\n\n**Claim:** where both a name and a formula are possible, the scheme prints the\ncondition — ignore a wrong formula if the name is right, or demand both correct.\n**Evidence:** \"silver bromide / AgBr If correct name given ignore incorrect formula\"\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 174-188); the parsed excerpt on the salt-identity point (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 200-214).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:rec:MS-015", "content_sha256": "da4cbc48c436072b2039a7e4aaddf177e758fa87489013fc52f3096c34f40ce7", "heading": "MS-015", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-015", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-015", "text": "### MS-015 — Explanation items name their required points\n\n**Claim:** linked explanations print the exact required points — M1 the fact, M2 the\nmechanism — each independently credit-bearing.\n**Evidence:** \"An explanation linking the following two points: M1 33 ALLOW R has\ntwo more protons than Q / M2 because the atomic number of R is two more (than Q)\"\nwith its two point lines (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 140-154).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:rec:MS-016", "content_sha256": "6e8592a31a7b043016d46a32413ca44964f365ae4bc66a74902fd3a812de0c32", "heading": "MS-016", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-016", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-016", "text": "### MS-016 — OWTTE: semantic equivalence, free wording\n\n**Claim:** OWTTE marks where wording is free provided the chemistry is right.\n**Evidence:** the clean-wire point accepts \"Impurities/ other ions/ other substances\ncould alter/interfere with the colour of the flame ... OWTTE\" — the parsed guidance\nshows the accepted semantic field and the OWTTE marker (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 211-225).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:rec:MS-017", "content_sha256": "620e9565c835d75101d9d793b531d08be5325fa11c58ec62791d57c71cceac22", "heading": "MS-017", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-017", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-017", "text": "### MS-017 — Alternative elements widen the requirement\n\n**Claim:** where more than one substance satisfies the chemistry, the requirement\nitself lists the alternatives.\n**Evidence:** \"Li+ ALLOW Sr2+\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 172-186); the group-similarity point accepts the outer-shell formulation with its\nown ALLOW column — \"ACCEPT outer energy level / ALLOW they need to lose 1 electron\nfrom the outer shell/ to gain a full outer shell\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 125-139).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-03", "chunk_id": "MS-03:rec:MS-018", "content_sha256": "0bbad1aab91f0412bf9d6bb67d982131f87bcfa073a337e326281a203914e70a", "heading": "MS-018", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-03", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-018", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-018", "text": "### MS-018 — CSQ-linked requirements\n\n**Claim:** some required elements are consequential on earlier answers — the scheme\nprints the CSQ note on the point itself.\n**Evidence:** \"lithium bromide / LiBr Mark CSQ on (a) and\" — the salt point's\nrequirement is tied to the earlier parts' answers (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/questions.md lines 200-214).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
